      </section>
      <section class="section-insight for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 horizontal w-container">
          <div class="column-wrapper">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2 left center-sm">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">WHAT WE LEARNED</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">Most B2B buyers</span> <br>decide with people<br>you&#x27;ll never meet</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-3 opacity-80">This is why a B2B video has to do more work than most people expect from it. It&#x27;s rarely watched by just one person, and it&#x27;s rarely watched only once, so here&#x27;s what that actually looks like in practice.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---01.avif" alt="A purple circle with a play button on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">The typical B2B buying group involves six to ten people, each bringing their own independently gathered research to the table before comparing notes with the rest (Gartner).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---02.avif" alt="A purple button with a blue envelope on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">86% of B2B purchases stall at some point during the buying process, which is exactly why content that can be revisited and shared matters more than a single conversation (Sopro).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple button with a speaker inside of it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">63% of B2B deals take at least three months to close, and one in five take over a year, so a single video is rarely doing its job in one sitting (Sopro).<br></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple button with a shopping cart on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Initial stakeholders and final decision-makers often have different priorities, which is why a video written for only one of them tends to lose the other (SBI).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-wrapper hide-small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67601fee10470581a90722d7/67602bd27d29b464069f8f7a_Key%20Insight.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-purpose for-whom">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478540_2Frame-1707478540.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif 2401w" alt="" src="/images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-3">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-4">
            <div class="top_side-800">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">The Advantages</div>
                <h2 class="h2"> How video keeps<br>‍<span class="span-pink-2">complex buying decision moving</span></h2>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">A strong B2B video gives everyone the same starting point. It makes the offer easier to understand, gives buyers something useful to share, and keeps the main case intact as more people become involved.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap-2">
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---01.avif" alt="A white circle with blue squares in it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Frame</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Put your product or service in the context of the problem the buying group is already trying to solve.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple star in a white circle" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Prove</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Support your claims with real product detail, customer evidence, or a clear demonstration of the outcome.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/BUILD-TRUST-ICON.svg" alt="" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Align</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Give product, finance, IT, procurement, and leadership one consistent understanding of what is being considered.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
