      <section class="section-faq for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="faq-wrapper">
            <div class="left_side-faq">
              <div class="header-faq">
                <div class="text_heading-faq">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                  <div class="max-w-400">
                    <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span">Questions B2B companies</span> <br>ask us most often</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
              </div><img src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" loading="lazy" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
            </div>
            <div class="right_side-faq">
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e149e" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What is B2B video production?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a2" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">B2B video production is video content made specifically to explain, demonstrate, or build trust in a product or service sold from one business to another. Unlike consumer video, it usually has to work for more than one type of viewer, since B2B purchases are rarely made by just one person.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a7" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How do you make a video that works for several different decision-makers at once?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14ab" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We build in layers, a clear, simple story anyone can follow on a first watch, with enough real detail underneath that someone evaluating the purchase seriously still gets what they need. Both types of viewer watch the same video, so it has to hold up for each.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b0" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our prospects often forward our content to people on their team we never speak to. Does that change how you approach the video?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, and it&#x27;s worth telling us upfront if that&#x27;s common in your sales process. We write the script assuming it may be watched by someone with no prior context, so it still makes sense without anyone from your team there to explain it.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our sales cycle is long. Can one video really help across a process that takes months?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14bd" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Often yes, though it usually works best as part of a small set rather than one video doing everything. A short explainer for early conversations and a more detailed case study or demo for later stage conversations tend to cover a long cycle better than a single video trying to do both jobs.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c2" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can this double as something our team uses directly in sales conversations, not just marketing?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. Most of our B2B clients use the same video in both places, on the website for early researchers and directly in conversations for people further along. Tell us that upfront and we&#x27;ll make sure it holds up in both settings.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What&#x27;s the pricing structure, and how do I get started?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We offer a fixed price for one-off project with a clear quote upfront, or a monthly subscription if you&#x27;re likely to need ongoing content. Book a call or request a free sample and we&#x27;ll ask a few questions about your product before quoting.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
